<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέκ-καυμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>combustible matter, fuel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Resp.</u>
				473a5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				341b19
			</span></i>, al.: metaph. of <i>food,</i> as supplying animal heat,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.694f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> the supposed
				<i>Sphere of Fire</i> surrounding the atmosphere, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				20.26
			</span></i>, al. (quoting <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., <i>provocative, incentive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς ὑ. ἔστ᾽ ἔρωτος μουσική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					237
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.80
			</span></i> K.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς νόσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					859b19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθου καὶ χάριτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
